{
    "title": "NewsNation: Unbiased News",
    "description": "Unbiased news begins with NewsNation. We\u2019re your fact-based network that\u2019s focused on bringing you the stories of our local communities which impacts us across the nation. Our network features the in-depth reporting power of Nexstar Media Inc.\u2019s 5,400 journalists in 110 local newsrooms across the country.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSTREAM THE NEWSNATION BROADCAST SHOWS\r\n\r\nMorning in America 6 a.m. ET\r\n\r\nNewsNation: Rush Hour 5 p.m. ET\r\n\r\nOn Balance with Leland Vittert 7 p.m. ET\r\n\r\nNewsNation Prime with Marni Hughes 8 p.m. ET\r\n\r\nDan Abrams Live 9 p.m. ET\r\n\r\nBanfield 10 p.m. ET\r\n\r\n(Log in with your cable provider to stream full episodes.)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWATCH ON-DEMAND VIDEO\r\n\r\nWatch on-demand video of breaking news from our NewsNation team.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGET PERSONALIZED WEATHER\r\n\r\nPersonalize the interactive radar and hourly weather forecast for where you live.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZE PUSH NOTIFICATIONS\r\n\r\nCustomize the news that\u2019s most important to you so you can be informed of breaking news.\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see http://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html  for more information.",
